Z||000020||FieroJoe||09-06-2001||02:15 PM||||Back on topic, anybody have oliver's unit installed, with pics of the unit and then pics of the actual image of the speed?  I have been thinking of getting one of these as part of the list of electrical work I'm doing this winter, and wanted to know how it looked.<P>Oliver suggests mounting the unit behind or on top of the aux cluster, for then the image would be reflected onto the windsheild below the mirror.  I am going to try and mount mine behind the IP, cover it in gray vinyl so it blends with the dash, and try to get the reflection just a few inches above the dash on the windsheild.<P>What do you all think about that location?||||reg||1
